	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Satis incolumem ad uxorem et liberos me redi<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>isse scito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ceterum in hoc mihi ipsi irascor, quod tibi atque <persName ref="p8011">Gualthero</persName>, tum et <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> pro dono d<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>atis et partim adscriptis et dedicatis ibris coram non gratias egerim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Distrahebatur quodam<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>modo animus meus propter viri illius, quem nosti, pręsentiam; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sed spero <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>meam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>peregrinationem bene successuram.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Historia de pistore, qui <placeName ref="l546">Viennę Austri<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ę</placeName> nuper sacramentum cęnę domini in lutum proiectum calcavit, verissima <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>est; brevi enim et nomen autoris et rem gestam ad te daturus sum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Cęsar haud ita pridem <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpię</placeName> equo insidens certe visus est, sed <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eger; instituit, ut audio, curam sibi peculiarem, ligni videlicet, suscipere <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et postea in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> redire; utrum vero prius effecerit, nescitur <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>adhuc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Magni profecto aliquid molitur; nam pecunias undiquaque cumulat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Regem <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName> egre ferre aiunt, quod ius imperii post mortem Cęsaris <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ei pręripiatur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName> res male habent; nam senatus solum hoc <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nunc satagit, quomodo evangelii puritatem aboleat et papatum mere <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>in integrum restituat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p8498">Marcellum Theodericum</persName> tibi commendo; vir certe frugi est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quod autem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>stipendiarium agit, videtur facere more militum Cęsareorum, quos olim d<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ivus Ioannes Baptista non omnino reiiciebat neque condemnabat; erant <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>enim illi etnici ducis famuli.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Rogo, ne graveris illi has inclusas trans<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>mittere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale et dic es me salutem dominis consulibus, prothonotario atque <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>toti Musarum choro.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Unicum porro te non lateat quandam feminam ex patriciis <placeName ref="l803">Tigurinorum</placeName> mecum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>in Termis lavisse, ex qua haud obscure didici vestros proceres anhelare <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>magistratus <placeName ref="l803">Tigurini</placeName> reformationem ad exemplar <placeName ref="l18">Augustanorum</placeName>; observate igitur <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>serpentes in sinu etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">G[e<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>orgius] <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>L[aetus</persName>]<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Herrn <persName ref="p495">Hennrichen Bullinger</persName>, vorgeern<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Antistes.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>der kirchen <placeName ref="l803">Zürch</placeName>, mynem <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>furgeliebten herren unnd frund, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>zu hannden.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
